          },
          "_name": "image04",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"image03\" group=\"Image & Video\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" value=\"0\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Caption\" name=\"showText\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"image-block m-auto\">\n        <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\"><img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/binance-p2.png\" alt=\"Binance\"></a>\n        <div mbr-if=\"showText\">\n            <p class=\"mbr-text mt-4 pb-4 align-center mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\">\n                Unlock your true path!\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vmf1DZVWnb",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {},
          "_anchor": "image04-3"
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"color\")": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = \"image\")": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            ".card-wrapper": {
              "background": "@wrapBgColor",
              "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
                "padding": "2rem 1.5rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 768px) and (max-width: 991px)": {
                "padding": "2.25rem"
              },
              "@media (min-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "4rem"
              }
            },
            ".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#000000",
              "text-align": "left"
            },
            ".card-title, .card-box": {
              "text-align": "left",
              "color": "#000000"
            }
          },
          "_name": "article07",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"article07\" group=\"Article\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\" checked>\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Content Width\" name=\"contentWidth\" min=\"8\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"10\">\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Wrap Bg\" name=\"wrapBgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#edefeb\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.3\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"card col-md-12 col-lg-{{contentWidth}}\">\n        <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n          <h3 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mbr-white mt-3 mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .card-box\"><b><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance</a>® App - Home Official Site</b></h3>\n          <div class=\"row card-box align-left\">\n            <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12\">\n              <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\"><b><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance</a>: The World's Leading Cryptocurrency Exchange</b></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Introduction :&gt;</b><br><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>is one of the largest and most influential cryptocurrency exchanges in the world. Since its launch in 2017, the platform has transformed the digital asset industry by providing users with a comprehensive ecosystem for trading, investing, and managing cryptocurrencies. With millions of users across the globe, Binance has become a central hub for both beginner and professional crypto investors.<br><br><b>The History of Binance ?<br></b><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>was founded in 2017 by Changpeng Zhao, commonly known as CZ. The company quickly gained popularity due to its user-friendly interface, low trading fees, and extensive selection of digital assets. Within months of its launch, Binance became one of the highest-volume cryptocurrency exchanges worldwide.<br><br>Originally established in China, Binance later relocated its operations due to changing regulatory conditions. Over the years, the company expanded globally, building services that extend far beyond simple cryptocurrency trading.<br><br><b>Key Features of Binance ://<br>1. Cryptocurrency Trading :&gt;</b><br><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>offers spot trading for hundreds of cryptocurrencies, including major assets such as Bitcoin, Ethereum, and BNB. Users can trade digital assets against various fiat currencies and stablecoins.<br><br><b>2. Futures and Margin Trading :&gt;</b><br>The platform provides advanced trading options, including futures contracts and margin trading. These features allow experienced traders to use leverage and implement sophisticated trading strategies.<br><br><b>3. Binance Earn :&gt;</b><br><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>Earn enables users to generate passive income through staking, savings products, and yield-generating opportunities. This feature has become popular among investors seeking to earn rewards on their crypto holdings.<br><br><b>4. Binance Wallet :&gt;</b><br>The platform offers secure wallet solutions for storing and managing digital assets. Users can access their funds through web and mobile applications while benefiting from various security measures.<br><br><b>5. Binance Academy :&gt;<br></b>Through <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>Academy, users can access free educational resources covering blockchain technology, cryptocurrency investing, security practices, and market analysis.<br><br><b>Binance Coin (BNB) //</b><br>BNB is the native cryptocurrency of the <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>ecosystem. Initially launched as a utility token, BNB now serves multiple purposes, including trading fee discounts, transaction payments, staking, and participation in ecosystem projects. Its utility has contributed significantly to its adoption within the cryptocurrency market.<br><br><b>Security and Compliance //<br></b>Security remains a major focus for <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance</a>. The exchange employs measures such as two-factor authentication (2FA), withdrawal verification, cold storage systems, and risk management tools. Binance has also invested heavily in compliance initiatives and regulatory engagement in various jurisdictions.<br><br>Despite these efforts, the company has faced regulatory scrutiny in several countries, highlighting the ongoing challenge of balancing innovation with evolving financial regulations.<br><br><b>Impact on the Cryptocurrency Industry //</b><br><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>has played a crucial role in the mainstream adoption of cryptocurrencies. By offering a broad range of services, liquidity, and educational resources, the exchange has helped millions of users gain access to digital assets. The company has also supported blockchain innovation through investments, startup incubation programs, and ecosystem development.<br><br><b>Challenges and Future Outlook //</b><br>Like many cryptocurrency businesses, <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>operates in a rapidly changing regulatory environment. Compliance requirements, cybersecurity threats, and market volatility continue to present challenges. However, the company's scale, technological capabilities, and global user base position it as a significant player in the future of digital finance.<br><br><b>Conclusion ://<br></b><a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>has evolved from a startup cryptocurrency exchange into a global blockchain ecosystem. Its extensive product offerings, innovative technology, and commitment to expanding access to digital assets have made it a dominant force in the cryptocurrency industry. As the digital economy continues to develop, <a href=\"https://www.binance.com/en\" class=\"text-primary\">Binance </a>is likely to remain an important participant in shaping the future of blockchain and financial technology.</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            \n            \n          </div>\n          <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n            <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Start Now</a>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "vmf1F6QJK7",
          "_anchor": "article07-4",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}